 "notes": "Plug-and-play & mini console: 92 old models plus 6 moved in from Home consoles (THE400 Mini, THEA500 Mini, THEC64 Mini, X68000 Z, Sport Vii, Xavix PORT) organised into 14 archetypes (Pong-era Magnavox Odyssey, Home Pong, Color TV-Game; TV-game lines Toymax, Jakks, Radica, Atari Flashback; official minis from Nintendo, Sony, SNK, Sega, Konami, Retro Games) with 39 smaller lines as flat models. LCD handheld game: Game & Watch series as archetypes (Silver to Crystal Screen plus the 2020 revival; old ranges became archetypes), Tiger LCD, Atari Flashback Portable, Game Gear Micro, Super Pocket; individual old G&W titles kept as models without assigning series. Tabletop: Coleco Mini-Arcade and Game & Watch Table Top archetypes, others as models. Nothing dropped. Old maker 'Legacy Engineering Group' kept as version maker. Vectrex Mini, ZX Spectrum Vega, Flynn's Generation still have no maker in old data."
}